   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **If All Else Fails**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **I Never Could Get Enough**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- **Complex**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **In Color**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2022-08-16.Beyerdynamic_CK930** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 144 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: First three tracks are incomplete or have phasing, because the taper moved around while seeking permission to set up [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2022-08-16.Beyerdynamic_CK930**: taped by Aaron Miller; transferred by Aaron Miller; source: Beyerdynamic CK930 Pair DINA > Naiant PFA > Zoom F3 @ 32 bit / 96 kHz [1]. Also: Taped from front of the sound cage with Beyerdynamic CK930 pair into Naiant PFA and Zoom F3, recorded at 32 bit/96 kHz; Transferred with iZotope RX7 and xAct to FLAC at 24 bit/48 kHz [1]",
